{"name":"Army Golf","hex":"#6c7735","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"army golf","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The situation when a player is spraying the golf ball all over the golf course in different directions."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/army_golf"}],"entries":[{"title":"Army","blocks":[{"text":"An army, ground force or land force is an armed force that fights primarily on land. In the broadest sense, it is the land-based military branch, service branch, or armed service of a nation or country. It may also include aviation assets by possessing an army aviation component. Within a national military force, the word army may also mean a field army."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/250th_United_States_Army_Birthday_Parade_in_Washington%2C_D.C._on_June_14%2C_2025_-_262.jpg/330px-250th_United_States_Army_Birthday_Parade_in_Washington%2C_D.C._on_June_14%2C_2025_-_262.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Army"},{"title":"Golf","blocks":[{"text":"Golf is a club-and-ball sport in which players use various clubs to hit a ball into a series of holes on a course in as few strokes as possible. The game was first played in the 15th century in Scotland, and as such, the country is often accredited as \"the home of Golf\"."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6e/Golfer_swing.jpg/330px-Golfer_swing.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Golf"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fe/The_Gorkha_Regiment_marching_contingent_passes_through_the_Rajpath_during_the_65th_Republic_Day_Parade_2014%2C_in_New_Delhi_on_January_26%2C_2014.jpg/500px-The_Gorkha_Regiment_marching_contingent_passes_through_the_Rajpath_during_the_65th_Republic_Day_Parade_2014%2C_in_New_Delhi_on_January_26%2C_2